{"id":"961cbe63813f3f0d","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-tree10-stem-of-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree10 Stem Of Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree10-stem-of-tree — ZFC Tree10 Stem Of Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree10-stem-of-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree10-stem-of-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree10-stem-of-tree — ZFC Tree10 Stem Of Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree10-stem-of-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree10-stem-of-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree10-stem-of-tree — ZFC Tree10 Stem Of Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,T,s\\in V\">\\(D,T,s\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq D^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq D^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree},\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree},\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10StemOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10StemOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}stem\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10StemOfTree}_S(s,T,D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\subseteq D^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\mathrm{Tree}\\bigl(T,\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T\\times T:u\\subseteq v\\}\\bigr)\n\\land s\\in T\\land\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq s)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall t\\in T\\;(u\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq u)\\bigr)\n\\to u\\subseteq s\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}stem\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10StemOfTree}_S(s,T,D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\subseteq D^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\mathrm{Tree}\\bigl(T,\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T\\times T:u\\subseteq v\\}\\bigr)\n\\land s\\in T\\land\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq s)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall t\\in T\\;(u\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq u)\\bigr)\n\\to u\\subseteq s\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The last conjunct makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> the longest node comparable with every node of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>; without it, every proper initial segment of the stem would also satisfy the definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tree},\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]], [[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tree},\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]], [[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,T,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq D^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tree},\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10StemOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}stem\\text{-}of\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10StemOfTree}_S(s,T,D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nT\\subseteq D^{<\\omega}\n\\land\\mathrm{Tree}\\bigl(T,\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in T\\times T:u\\subseteq v\\}\\bigr)\n\\land s\\in T\\land\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;(s\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq s)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall t\\in T\\;(u\\subseteq t\\lor t\\subseteq u)\\bigr)\n\\to u\\subseteq s\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1342,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3774","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree10-stem-of-tree.md|58-df-zfc-tree10-stem-of-tree]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f06e57c5c0b1354d","f4bf86f66c1444da"]}